{"meta":{"id":"tt0082198","type":"movie","name":"Conan, el bárbaro","imdb_id":"tt0082198","description":"En la historia de la humanidad, los tiempos más recordados son aquellos de las grandes hazañas y fantásticas aventuras. Esa es la época de Conan el Bárbaro. Conan es capturado cuando tan sólo era un niño después que sus padres fueran asesinados por el malvado Thulsa Doom, el cabecilla de una secta de adoradores a la Serpiente. Quince años de agonía forjarón a Conan como un guerrero insuperable. Liberado por su dueño, Conan, en compañía de sus amigos Subotai, Mongol y Valeria, Reina de los Ladrones, emprenden un viaje en busca de venganza y sabiduría.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0082198.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fNp2ikvY8WZTyVbK1iXW84RLbO5.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v5l3bqPTGkKYl0m6ujUuLr9dTKk.png","genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"1982","released":"1982-03-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"130 min","imdbRating":"6.9","country":"United States","cast":["Arnold Schwarzenegger","James Earl Jones","Sandahl Bergman","Ben Davidson","Cassandra Gava","Gerry Lopez","Mako","Valérie Quennessen","William Smith","Max von Sydow","Franco Columbu","Sven-Ole Thorsen","Nadiuska","Jorge Sanz","Luis Barboo","Leslie Foldvary","Gary Herman","Erik Holmey","Akio Mitamura","Jack Taylor","Kiyoshi Yamasaki","Corrie Jansen","Ron Cobb","Andrea Guzon","John Milius","Olvido Lorente","Celia Milius","Florencio Amarilla","Fabián Conde","Pilar Alcón"],"director":["John Milius"],"writer":["Robert E. Howard","Oliver Stone","John Milius"],"trailers":[{"source":"mwLBes2Gr8E","type":"Trailer","name":"Original Trailer","ytId":"mwLBes2Gr8E","lang":"en"},{"source":"Nok-jOYn6Dg","type":"Trailer","name":"Conan the Barbarian 1982 Trailer | Arnold Schwarzenegger","ytId":"Nok-jOYn6Dg","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"mwLBes2Gr8E","title":"Original Trailer"},{"